Subject: [PATCH] sonic-host-services support for factory reset

---
 host_modules/gnoi_reset.py | 149 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 scripts/sonic-host-server  |   5 +-
 tests/gnoi_reset_test.py   | 114 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 266 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
